                                                "sense_id": "c4648ab8-078f-3d52-ae3d-7158444e05c5",
                                                "text": "Based on Parent's report, 26.2% of children showed bruxism and there was a significant relation between bruxism and mother's job, family history, distressing event in life, parasomnias, especially drooling and sleep walking, TMD, hyperactivity, depression, acrophobia and lygophobia."
                                            },
